('e744a2af-a4d1-a993-ee8e-d374babcc360', 'Pedro', 'Burro', 'Gray', 'GELDING', '1992', null, null, 'Pedro is our little burro. He is absolutely in love with his lady, Sioux. ', null, 'false', CURRENT_DATE, CURRENT_DATE);